# The images install their own dependencies. A host's virtualenv or node_modules copied in by
# `COPY backend/` or `COPY frontend/` would replace them with ones built for another machine.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
backend/.pytest_cache
backend/.ruff_cache
backend/.hypothesis
backend/instance
backend/.env
frontend/dist
deploy/.env
.git
